-- The agency's rule (owner, 23/10/2026): RMA series are numbered 14 and CAT series 91, one per
-- national model. The 6 series seen on the forms already exist; this adds the 10 others (RMA 14 B/D/F/G,
-- CAT 91 A/B/C/D/F/G) as « à confirmer ». The number and the model of each series stay editable in
-- the catalogue; npm run catalogue:confirm-reference confirms them in an administrator's name.

-- reference-data:begin
-- The complete reference rows as of this migration; integration and e2e tests replay the block
-- of the latest migration that has one (test/referenceData.js). Every insert skips rows that
-- exist, so on a database migrated from the previous step only the models are new.
-- Models, usages and series stay TO_CONFIRM until a manager confirms them in the app.

